// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2868933301" "Take crystals to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1594304556" "Those crystals you found in Oranbega's Magic Library may have all kinds of mystic properties. Azuria should know how to handle them."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1520724799" "The surface world will afford you no protection from us!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P468405025" "We must recover the crystals!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3175119722" "You are only a small obstacle, and a short-lived one at that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P541788823" "I have felt the strange vibrations of these crystals ever since you brought them up from the ruins of Oranbega. They hold a great deal of energy, and are wrapped in layers of spells. I would guess that they are some sort of tool used in the Circle's magical training. Each crystal is a repository of knowledge. I will study them, and get my findings to {ContactName} at once. <br><br>I must tell you one more thing, {HeroName}. You appeared in one of my visions last night. I see much danger in your future, as well as much opportunity. I do not know if it is for good or ill, I believe we shall soon learn a great deal about the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P337166354" "MAGI is studying the artifacts you found in Oranbega's Magic Library. As soon as they know anything, they'll pass it along."
// RandomFameString :
"P3278555155" "All of City Hall is buzzing about {HeroName} lately."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1880955673" "I just heard from Azuria. She hit a road block while trying to analyze those crystals you found in the Oranbegan Magic Library, so she called in a specialist: Naomi Hutchins, expert in geometric magics and earth sorceries. Trouble is, Naomi never showed up. She was kidnapped by the Circle before she even got to MAGI! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I know it's a lot to ask,  {HeroName}, but someone must rescue Naomi Hutchins before the Circle makes sure she's never heard from again.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2372792678" "Rescue Naomi Hutchins"
// SendOffString :
"P2499717441" "I'd hate to see Naomi end up like poor Edgar Torvald. We've got to get her back before the Circle can silence her with the same brutal tactics."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P24139312" "Defeat kidnapper, his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P233768287" "Naomi Hutchins won't last long in the Circle's hands, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1131328043" "The last time you tried to rescue one of the Circle's victims, you found him dead. You can only hope the same fate hasn't befallen Naomi Hutchins."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1328790446" "The Talon of Flame"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P861241609" "I was summoned to consume a human scholar. Akarist had best not renege on this pact."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P570670659" "My promised prey may be denied to me, but you will do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3660476197" "Naomi Hutchins"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4029278569" "I thought I was done for. Listen, I have something important to tell you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3939652414" "You have rescued Naomi Hutchins and defeated her captors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1877752194" "Naomi Hutchins is safe at MAGI, thanks to you. She seems to have learned a lot from her time in the Circle's captivity. We may soon know more about those strange crystals you found. From the sound of her story, Naomi was saved by one of the Circle's own mages, this Akarist. Puzzling, {HeroName}. Puzzling."
// RandomFameString :
"P3343592249" "{HeroName} is really something!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2294656011" "When you rescued Naomi Hutchins from the Circle of Thorns, she said she was protected by a Circle mystic named Akarist. If he really did save Naomi and tell her how to access those strange crystals you found, maybe he's trying to get that information to us. Maybe he's even looking to change sides. I've never heard of a Circle defector before; this could well be a first! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to find this Akarist and see if he's really on our side.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2951438432" "Find Akarist"
// SendOffString :
"P2586427879" "From Naomi's description, this Akarist sounds pretty powerful. I'd suggest that you ready yourself in case he isn't willing to talk."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P718349761" "Find Akarist, his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P387904598" "If Akarist isn't willing to talk, you may have to take him on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1994264562" "The ancient depths of the lost city seem endless."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3902314529" "Akarist"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P46588529" "I know that you're here, {HeroName}. I know why you are here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2137578065" "This time we must fight. But should you defeat me, I may have something for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P527437340" "You have defeated Akarist. After the battle, you found a crumpled note tucked into his robes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1664069703" "I hoped that Akarist was willing to leave the Circle, but that may have been too optimistic. No one ever leaves the Circle. This note he left you is so strange. At least we can thank him for telling us how to unravel the protection spells on those crystals you found. I'll check in with MAGI and see if they've made any progress."
// RandomFameString :
"P3724577846" "{HeroName} has been working with MAGI on something big."

