// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2779992848" "I had a chance to speak with Azuria over at MAGI about those crystals you found in the Circle's Magic Library. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you need to go over there and talk to her right away.</A> They've found out what those crystals really are, and Azuria sounded pretty shaken up."
// AcceptString :
"P4048120735" "Talk to Azuria"
// SendOffString :
"P1003772058" "I've never heard Azuria sound this ruffled, {HeroName}. You better hurry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1255884631" "Talk to Azuria about crystals"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3231846057" "Azuria's expecting you. She has important information about those crystals you found."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P267072568" "The Circle mystic, Akarist, pointed our research in the proper direction. Thanks to him, we now know exactly what these crystals are. <br><br>They are receptacles, crystaline cages for the souls of those who have been cast from their bodies by the Circle of Thorns!<br><br>The brightly glowing crystal contains over a dozen such souls, from an ancient Roman centurian to a Dawn Patrol hero who dissapeared in the late 30's.<br><br>That shadowed crystal is a prison for souls who have been uncooperative. We believe that there are two spirits trapped in there right now. Finally, the clear crystal is used to transport a captured soul. It seems you didn't raid a library of arcane lore, but a Library of Souls!<br><br>One of the displaced souls told us a horrifying thing about the Circle's spirit thorns. We aren't yet sure we can trust it, but we do know that the Circle plans to release several of these spirit thorns onto the black market. You must stop this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4122593866" "Recover spirit thorns"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2063066582" "You must prevent the Circle form releasing those spirit thorns onto the black market!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2346648425" "Azuria's instructions have led you to an old warehouse. The prickling hairs on your arms alert you to the presence of something unnatural."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1173244313" "These thorns should gain us many new vessels!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4171483521" "Indeed."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3828758792" "Thorn Keeper"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2790067238" "The Warriors are late for the meeting."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2331731037" "Can no plan occur in this city without meddling?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Display 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3787915087" "You have recovered the Circle's strange spirit thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound5_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3532802204" "Return thorns to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1559364833" "You need to get those spirit thorns back to Azuria, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4085077469" "Find the one who stole the spirit thorns!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P527313020" "From the souls trapped within these crystals, we have learned the true nature of the spirit thorns. We always assumed that they were relics of power given to the Circle's favored members. Now we know that they are traps! When a mage plunges a spirit thorn into his heart, it opens a gateway into his very soul that the Circle can exploit. Through it they can posses the thorn bearer, overriding his will, supplanting and imprisoning his very soul. {HeroName}, this is a vile and evil magic. Thank you for preventing its spread."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3912642284" "Trapped souls in crystals, spirit thorns that destroy souls, and the Circle of Thorns presiding over it all from the depths of Oranbega. It's unbelievable! I'm simply amazed that the Circle has been using those spirit thorns to override the souls of new devotees. I knew they were evil, but I never knew they cannibalized their own acolytes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3615655383" "The souls trapped within the Circle's crystals continue to give Azuria more information about the Circle of Thorns and their sunken city of Oranbega. One of them claims to know the location of a great Library of Souls where many more spirits are kept in torment. However, the soul needs to orient himself before he can remember the library's exact location. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you take the crystal containing a dead man's soul to find the place where he died?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P942369880" "Help the soul within the crystal orient itself"
// SendOffString :
"P1861592327" "I knew you wouldn't falter. Azuria sent me the crystal containing the spirit who's willing to help us. His name is Ashton Fletcher, and according to what he told us, he was a sailor aboard the Novus Cartago Expedition in the early 1600's. Mr. Fletcher here will need to get his bearings. In order to do that, he asks to be returned to the last place he went before he met his fate at the hands of the Circle of Thorns."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2446723835" "Find landmarks"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3758804574" "The soul within the crystal still needs to orient himself. You should find some more landmarks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2235652526" "Ashton's spirit has led you to this place. It yearns to go inside and explore, but you can see telltale signs that the Devouring Earth have taken up residence here."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P292039156" "I know that presence. {HeroName} is here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1201131215" "Surprised to see me again? You shouldn't be!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Spot1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3475908937" "Rubble"
// Description :
"P237835502" "landmarks to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P2522603355" "Find the last landmark!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1066298153" "You hold the crystal over the rubble."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1524615027" "You take the crystal back."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P671258472" "You can sense that Ashton's soul remembers this place. It is here that he and his comrades tried to dig their way out of the Circle's trap."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Spot2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P116276477" "Strange stone marker"
// InteractBeginString :
"P505259335" "You hold the crystal over the stone marker."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4260090969" "You can sense that Ashton's soul remembers this place. It was this intriguing marker stone that convinced Ashton and his comrades to explore the caves further."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Spot3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3626720794" "Bones"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2767377025" "You hold the crystal over the bones."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P491895518" "You can sense that Ashton's soul recognizes these bones and feeble tatters of clothing. This body was once his own."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P615500034" "Here's the crystal. The soul inside is named Ashton Fletcher. It seems like he's pretty eager to help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4155017943" "Ashton's soul has found its bearings. As you ready to leave, you find a scribbled note from the Circle mystic Akarist."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3601259549" "Thanks for helping Ashton's soul get his bearings. Now that he's oriented himself, he should be able to take us to the underground library where the rest of the Circle's imprisoned souls are kept. You say that Circle mystic was there again? Akarist? How strange. These messages he keeps sending you are so cryptic. What is he getting at?"
// RandomFameString :
"P3595448854" "I saw {HeroName} walking around with some sort of New Age crystal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1088458158" "With your help, one of the trapped souls you recovered has shown us the way to the Greater Library of Souls, deep within the ruins of Oranbega. The souls of hundreds, possibly thousands of Paragon's missing are trapped down there, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you liberate those imprisoned souls?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2831373584" "Liberate the imprisoned souls"
// SendOffString :
"P765838194" "According to Ashton's soul, there are ten crystals down there, each of which holds a hundred or more trapped souls. As soon as you recover all ten, get them to MAGI. They'll know how to keep the crystals safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound7_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2636826483" "Liberate the Library of Souls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2136949172" "There could be thousands of people's spirits trapped down there, {HeroName}. You may be their only hope for freedom."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3981352328" "You hear the whispers of tormented spirits in the echo of every footstep."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1180054397" "I sense a presence. The Library is under attack!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P155251259" "Find the intruder!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P2997127031" "I will boil your blood!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P2676066922" "I will send your soul to the netherworld!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P218982034" "I will not brook these disruptions!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4292883073" "I will personally add you to our collection!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Souls 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4072314255" "soul crystals remaining"
// SingularDescription :
"P779745026" "Find the last soul crystal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2023180261" "You have recovered a soul crystal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TormentedSouls 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3375541804" "You have recovered a dark soul crystal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2833820429" "You have recovered all of the soul crystals."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Compound7_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P565576430" "Now that you have all the soul crystals, you must get them to Azuria without delay."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1992083174" "No one steals from the Circle of Thorns!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1473204385" "Recover the crystals!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2536681272" "You won't get far, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P288094320" "Hand over the crystals, or die!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4272051545" "I am relieved to see that you have recovered all the soul crystals. As we learn more about these severed souls, I foresee a day when we may be able to release them from their crystal prisons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P171957317" "It will take MAGI years to sort through all of the souls trapped in those crystals and put them to rest. But without you, {HeroName}, they wouldn't even have a chance. <br><br>You know, I've been thinking. Do you remember Ashton Fletcher, the sailor from the 1600's whose soul was in the first crystal you found? From what we know, the Circle of Thorns started in the 1920's when Baron Zoria discovered Oranbega and unlocked its magics. So how could Ashton have been trapped by the Circle of Thorns way back in the 17th century? I have a feeling that the souls you recovered might still have some things to tell us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P139943628" "{HeroName}, I just got word from MAGI. They've made contact with one of the souls in the strangely darkened crystal you recovered from the Greater Library of Souls. It claims to be the soul of Lord Frostimus, one of Baron Zoria's old allies from the 1920's. What's more, it claims that the Baron himself is also a prisoner in another soul crystal! It says that it was transferred from the Baron's crystal to make room for a special guest: a Circle of Thorns traitor named Akarist! {HeroName}, if half of what Frostimus claims is true, this could be the biggest break we've ever had against the Circle of Thorns. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you recover Zoria and Akarist?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1153879547" "Recover Zoria and Akarist"
// SendOffString :
"P4133621105" "You should be able to find Zoria in a dark soul crystal, like the one you already recovered. I don't know whether Akarist's alive or dead, but keep your eyes peeled for him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1311231184" "Rescue Zoria and Akarist"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2484124634" "Have you recovered Zoria and Akarist? No? Well, get cracking."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2985788135" "You have seen much of Oranbega, but today the crushing weight of its age presses down on you as never before."
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P315772655" "Akarist is powerful; his bindings must be permanent!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P39538521" "Destroy the fools!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1281421918" "For the moment, I stay my hand. Count yourself lucky, Furias."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4280199059" "Furias"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1224035190" "Don't make me laugh, Akarist. You're lucky we don't discorporate you."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2838965792" "Destroy the intruder!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P3476728025" "For now, I will aid you against my brethren."
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P3785407522" "You have done well. I see your skill matches your dedication."
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P1028790059" "I'm in danger!"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P1930199319" "Thank you for your assistance."
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P1856871568" "I cannot match your pace!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Akarist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - TheBaron 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3844772014" "The moment you pick up this crystal you can sense the tortured thoughts of a madman in Hell."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2906922799" "You have recovered Baron Zoria and rescued Akarist."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1645752881" "So, the Circle's acolytes are really just hollow shells, inhabited by the spirits of long-dead Oranbegans? Ugh, Akarist was right. I almost wish I didn't know. This is mind-boggling, {HeroName}! All those ghosts, living under our feet for thousands of years! You've done the city a great service by uncovering this secret. Now that we know how they operate, perhaps we can strengthen our fight against the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P3595967888" "I think {HeroName} may be the greatest hero of our time!"
